{"event": "\u001b[2m2025-11-26T21:48:09.871972+01:00\u001b[0m [\u001b[31m\u001b[1merror    \u001b[0m] \u001b[1mFailed to recover pending jobs\u001b[0m [\u001b[0m\u001b[1m\u001b[34mcore.jobs\u001b[0m]\u001b[0m \u001b[36mapp\u001b[0m=\u001b[35mstreamlit-robust\u001b[0m \u001b[36menvironment\u001b[0m=\u001b[35mdev\u001b[0m \u001b[36merror\u001b[0m=\u001b[35m\"(sqlite3.OperationalError) no such table: jobs\\n[SQL: SELECT jobs.id AS jobs_id, jobs.name AS jobs_name, jobs.function_name AS jobs_function_name, jobs.args AS jobs_args, jobs.kwargs AS jobs_kwargs, jobs.priority AS jobs_priority, jobs.scheduled_at AS jobs_scheduled_at, jobs.timeout AS jobs_timeout, jobs.retry_count AS jobs_retry_count, jobs.max_retries AS jobs_max_retries, jobs.retry_delay AS jobs_retry_delay, jobs.retry_backoff AS jobs_retry_backoff, jobs.retry_jitter AS jobs_retry_jitter, jobs.depends_on AS jobs_depends_on, jobs.tags AS jobs_tags, jobs.created_by AS jobs_created_by, jobs.created_at AS jobs_created_at, jobs.metadata AS jobs_metadata, jobs.cron_expression AS jobs_cron_expression \\nFROM jobs JOIN job_results ON jobs.id = job_results.job_id \\nWHERE job_results.status IN (?, ?, ?)]\\n[parameters: ('pending', 'queued', 'retrying')]\\n(Background on this error at: https://sqlalche.me/e/20/e3q8)\"\u001b[0m \u001b[36mversion\u001b[0m=\u001b[35m2.0.0\u001b[0m", "level": "error", "logger": "core.jobs", "timestamp": "2025-11-26T21:48:09.872561+01:00", "environment": "dev", "app": "streamlit-robust", "version": "2.0.0"}
